<title>TURKEY: Turkish shares up 2.9 pct, political tension fades.</title>
<headline>Turkish shares up 2.9 pct, political tension fades.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Istanbul shares surged in late buying on Thursday as week-long political concerns over the fate of the Islamist-led coalition government died down, brokers said.</p>
<p>The IMKB National-100 closed at 1,469, up 42 points, or 2.94 percent from Thursday after brushing a low of 1,426 in early trade.</p>
